#: templates/orion/integrations/integrations.html:55
msgid "Test"
msgstr "Prueba"

#: templates/orion/integrations/integrations.html:59
msgid "Send test email"
msgstr "Mandar email de prueba"

#: templates/orion/integrations/integrations.html:63
msgid "How to activate it"
msgstr "Cómo activarlo"

#: templates/orion/integrations/integrations.html:65
msgid ""
"Create a mailbox for the site in the domain's cPanel, for example no-"
"reply@yourdomain.com (Email > Email Accounts). It is the recommended option; "
"a dedicated provider (Brevo, Amazon SES) is only worth it for high volume or "
"spam problems."
msgstr ""
"Crear una casilla para el sitio en el cPanel del dominio, por ejemplo no-"
"responder@tudominio.com (Email > Cuentas de email). Es la opción "
"recomendada; un proveedor dedicado (Brevo, Amazon SES) solo conviene con "
"mucho volumen o problemas de spam."

#: templates/orion/integrations/integrations.html:66
msgid ""
"Open “Connect Devices” for that mailbox in cPanel and copy the outgoing "
"server (SMTP), its port and the security: port 465 uses SSL, port 587 uses "
"TLS."
msgstr ""
"Abrir “Conectar dispositivos” de esa casilla en cPanel y copiar el servidor "
"de salida (SMTP), su puerto y la seguridad: el puerto 465 usa SSL y el 587, "
"TLS."

#: templates/orion/integrations/integrations.html:68
msgid ""
"Whoever manages the server loads these environment variables and restarts "
"the site:"
msgstr ""
"Quien administra el servidor carga estas variables de entorno y reinicia el "
"sitio:"

#: templates/orion/integrations/integrations.html:69
msgid "or"
msgstr "o"

#: templates/orion/integrations/integrations.html:70
msgid "The password never goes in the admin."
msgstr "La contraseña nunca va en el admin."

#: templates/orion/integrations/integrations.html:72
msgid ""
"In the admin, each form sets its recipients, its subject and the sender's "
"name; replying to a notice writes to the visitor."
msgstr ""
"En el admin, cada formulario define sus destinatarios, su asunto y el nombre "
"del remitente; responder un aviso le escribe al visitante."

#: templates/orion/integrations/integrations.html:73
msgid ""
"Send a test email from this screen and check that it does not land in spam."
msgstr ""
"Mandar un email de prueba desde esta pantalla y revisar que no llegue como "
"spam."

#: templates/orion/integrations/integrations.html:75
msgid "Keep in mind"
msgstr "Para tener en cuenta"

#: templates/orion/integrations/integrations.html:77
msgid ""
"Hostings limit how many emails go out per hour, and every site on the server "
"shares its reputation."
msgstr ""
"Los hostings limitan cuántos emails salen por hora, y todos los sitios del "
"servidor comparten su reputación."

#: templates/orion/integrations/integrations.html:78
msgid ""
"If the domain's DNS is not at the hosting, add the SPF and DKIM records that "
"cPanel shows under Email Deliverability; otherwise the emails end up in spam."
msgstr ""
"Si el DNS del dominio no está en el hosting, agregar los registros SPF y "
"DKIM que muestra cPanel en Entregabilidad del email; si no, los emails "
"terminan en spam."

#: templates/orion/integrations/integrations.html:79
msgid ""
"Some hostings only let sites send through localhost: then EMAIL_HOST is "
"localhost, usually on port 25 without user or security."
msgstr ""
"Algunos hostings solo dejan mandar desde localhost: entonces EMAIL_HOST es "
"localhost, normalmente en el puerto 25 sin usuario ni seguridad."

#: templates/orion/integrations/integrations.html:80
msgid ""
"When the server fails, the form notices wait and the orion_retry_form_emails "
"task sends them again."
msgstr ""
"Si el servidor falla, los avisos de formularios esperan y la tarea "
"orion_retry_form_emails los vuelve a mandar."

#: templates/orion/integrations/integrations.html:87
msgid "Maps"
msgstr "Mapas"

#: templates/orion/integrations/integrations.html:90
#, python-format
msgid "Map tiles come from %(host)s."
msgstr "Las teselas del mapa vienen de %(host)s."

#: templates/orion/integrations/integrations.html:92
msgid ""
"OpenStreetMap is free, but its usage policy does not allow heavy traffic. A "
"site with many visits needs another tile provider, set up by the developer "
"in ORION_MAP_TILES."
msgstr ""
"OpenStreetMap es gratuito, pero su política de uso no admite tráfico alto. "
"Un sitio con muchas visitas necesita otro proveedor de teselas, que "
"configura el desarrollador en ORION_MAP_TILES."

#: views.py:21
msgid "Send a test email to"
msgstr "Mandar un email de prueba a"

